1
00:00:00,224 --> 00:00:03,464
(Penny:)He doesn't think
that's funny.

2
00:00:04,695 --> 00:00:06,865
(static crackling)

3
00:00:07,832 --> 00:00:09,502
(gasps)

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,670
(sighs)

5
00:00:15,573 --> 00:00:17,243
(knocking)

6
00:00:17,241 --> 00:00:19,611
(Amy:)I got here
as quickly as I could.

7
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:21,910
(Sheldon:)You're too late.

8
00:00:26,684 --> 00:00:29,314
("Taps" playing)

9
00:00:40,765 --> 00:00:42,995
(Amy:)Sheldon, this is silly.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,340
(Sheldon:)You got emotional
when that lab monkey died.

11
00:00:46,337 --> 00:00:50,277
(Amy:)That lab monkey told me
he loved me in sign language.

12
00:00:50,274 --> 00:00:59,024
♪ ♪

